issue_context.body:
**Describe the problem**

Consider the following test:
```sql
CREATE DATABASE db;
USE db;
CREATE SCHEMA sc;
BEGIN;
    CREATE SCHEMA sc2;
    SELECT * FROM crdb_internal.tables;
    DROP SCHEMA sc CASCADE;
COMMIT;
```

This now fails, and it was broken in https://github.com/cockroachdb/cockroach/pull/87067

**Additional context**
This was discovered while investigating https://github.com/cockroachdb/cockroach/issues/78478. 

Jira issue: CRDB-19466
